  - name: Bareos Backup Failure
    detail: A backup has exited with an Error status 
    fluxfile: flux/bareos_error.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 0.0
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - client
      - level
      - _field
      - _measurement
    interval: 3600
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              There is a serious problem with the backups running on cibccaprodadm1. 
              Log in to the server and the bareos console. Check the status of the failed, running and waiting backup. 
              Escalate if there are underlying error (e.g. media/storage errors). 
